<view class="page mine {{demoMode ? 'page--demo' : ''}} {{fontClass}}">
  <view class="profile">
    <view class="title">云端小棉袄-曹艳</view>
    <view class="role">当前身份：{{roleText}}</view>
    <view class="desc">女儿发布留言；妈妈、爸爸都可以绑定进来观看、点「收到了」。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="group">
    <view class="row">
      <text>演示模式</text>
      <switch checked="{{demoMode}}" color="#D96B54" bindchange="onDemoChange" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text>更大字体</text>
      <switch checked="{{largerFont}}" color="#D96B54" bindchange="onFontChange" />
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="onPickRole">
      <text>切换体验身份</text>
      <text class="value">{{roleText}} ›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="onSetCity">
      <text>天气城市</text>
      <text class="value">{{weatherCity}} ›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="onResetUnread" wx:if="{{demoMode}}">
      <text>演示：制造未读角标</text>
      <text class="value">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="invite-card">
    <view class="invite-title">家庭邀请</view>
    <view class="invite-desc">
      爸妈都能用：你把邀请码发给他们，他们打开小程序 → 输入邀请码 → 选「妈妈」或「爸爸」绑定。绑定后可看时光轴、听语音、点轻反馈；不能录音发帖。
    </view>

    <view class="invite-block">
      <view class="invite-label">我的邀请码（发给家人）</view>
      <view class="invite-code-row">
        <text class="invite-code">{{inviteCode}}</text>
        <view class="invite-btn" bindtap="onInvite">复制</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="invite-block">
      <view class="invite-label">家人绑定入口（对方看到的步骤）</view>
      <view class="bind-steps">
        <view class="step">1. 打开「云端小棉袄-曹艳」</view>
        <view class="step">2. 进「我的」→ 输入邀请码</view>
        <view class="step">3. 选择身份：妈妈 / 爸爸</view>
        <view class="step">4. 完成绑定，即可观看</view>
      </view>
      <view class="invite-btn wide" bindtap="onBind">输入邀请码绑定</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="group" wx:if="{{isPublisher}}">
    <view class="row" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/publish-voice/publish-voice">
      <text>发语音</text>
      <text class="value">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/publish-transfer/publish-transfer">
      <text>记心意</text>
      <text class="value">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/publish-note/publish-note">
      <text>写纸条（可带图）</text>
      <text class="value">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="group">
    <view class="about-title">关于</view>
    <view class="about-body">
      给爸妈：这是女儿曹艳做的小程序。你们给我的心意我都记着；我也会留下语音和小纸条陪你们。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
